<title>BELGIUM: EU warns Unilever over Irish freezer rules.</title>
<headline>EU warns Unilever over Irish freezer rules.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Friday it had again warned Unilever over its freezer cabinet rules in Ireland after the company's proposed changes failed to open the market to fair competition.</p>
<p>The Commission forced Unilever in 1993 to modify its distribution arrangements regarding the selling of so-called impulse ice cream in Ireland after it received complaints from rival companies Master Foods Ireland (Mars) and Valley Ice Cream Ltd.</p>
</text>
